      {
        "id": 10565,
        "name": "BlueHairedMeerkat",
        "username": "BlueHairedMeerkat",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/{size}/1967_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-22T15:29:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So previously I've calculated how many possible configurations of Sentinels exist (see&nbsp;<span>https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/statistics-with-a-vengeance-4672), and now I have a GSF it's time to do MORE STATS! :D</span></p><p><span>So, let's start with the heroes! There are 10C2 = 10 x 9 / 2 = 45 two-ship teams, 10C3 = 120 three-ship teams, 10C4 = 210 four-ship teams, 10C5 = 252 five-ship teams and 10C6 = 210 six-ship teams, so we have a grand total of&nbsp;<strong>837</strong>&nbsp;Strike Force permutations.&nbsp;</span><span>With Volneth, we have twelve sectors, and thus 12C3 =&nbsp;</span><strong>220</strong><span>&nbsp;combinations of sectors. Finally, five opposition forces with two difficulties each give&nbsp;<strong>10&nbsp;</strong>villains total. So 837 x 220 x 10 =&nbsp;<strong>1,841,400&nbsp;</strong>possible games. That is a very large number!</span></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:41:39.061Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 5.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 10562,
        "topic_slug": "galactic-stat-force",
        "display_username": "BlueHairedMeerkat",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
